{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_7_6_2_6_2_OBD_DID","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager","page":130,"text":"7.6.2.6.2 OBD DID\n[SWS_Dcm_00481] ⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22),\nfor every requested DID inside the OBD range (F400-F4FF), the Dcm module\nshall get the DID value as defined for OBD Service $01 (see [SWS_Dcm_00407],\n[SWS_Dcm_00408], [SWS_Dcm_00943], [SWS_Dcm_00621], [SWS_Dcm_00622],\n[SWS_Dcm_00623], [SWS_Dcm_00944] and [SWS_Dcm_00718] ), if DcmDspEn-\nableObdMirror is set to true.⌋()\n[SWS_Dcm_00482] ⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22),\nfor every requested DID inside the OBD Monitor range (F600-F6FF), the Dcm mod-\nule shall get the DID value as defined for OBD Service $06 (see [SWS_Dcm_00957],\n[SWS_Dcm_00958], [SWS_Dcm_00945] and [SWS_Dcm_00956])⌋()\n[SWS_Dcm_00483] ⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22),\nfor every requested DID inside the OBD InfoType range (F800-F8FF), the Dcm mod-\nule shall get the DID value as defined for OBD Service $09 (see [SWS_Dcm_00422],\n[SWS_Dcm_00423] and [SWS_Dcm_00949] without including the number of data\nitems within the response, if DcmDspEnableObdMirror is set to true.⌋()\n[SWS_Dcm_01195] ⌈If DcmDspEnableObdMirror is set to true, an explicitly config-\nured DID inside the OBD range (F400-F4FF) and the OBD InfoType range (F800-F8FF)\nshall use the UDS interface.⌋()\n[SWS_Dcm_01197] ⌈If DcmDspEnableObdMirror is set to FALSE, all requests\nwithin the OBD DID range shall use the UDS interface.⌋()\nIf DcmDspEnableObdMirror is set to FALSE ([SWS_Dcm_01197]) or the DID is ex-\nplicitly configured inside the OBD PID range (F400-F4FF) ([SWS_Dcm_01195]), the\naccess to the OBD data shall be given in the following way:\n[SWS_Dcm_01379] ⌈On reception of an UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22) re-\nquest with only ”availability OBDDataIdentifier” as parameter, the Dcm shall respond\nwith the corresponding supported (=configured) DIDs in the OBD range (F400-F4FF).⌋\n()\nManager\n[SWS_Dcm_01380] ⌈On reception of an UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22) re-\nquest with only OBDDataIdent…","caption":"7.6.2.6.2 OBD DID","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_7_6_2_6_2_OBD_DID","releases":["R23-11"],"page":130,"hash":"31de42ee2226f595","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/806c959f5e5d/page_130.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/806c959f5e5d/page_130.webp","trel":"R23-11","tstat":"section","drop":"R24-11","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00407] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00407"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00408] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00408"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00422] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00422"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00423] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00423"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00481] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00481"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00482] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00482"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00483] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00483"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFEREN